  "messages": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "offset": "TUTORIAL_MES_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Serph and Heat devoured the\ndefeated enemies.\n> After the battle, their HP will\nrecover slightly because they\nconsumed their enemies.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "offset": "HARRY_EVENT_01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Yeaargh!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "offset": "HARRY_EVENT_01_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Raise the wall!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "offset": "BATTLE_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "There's a voice in my head...\nIt keeps saying... devour...\nKeep devouring... Devour more...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "offset": "BATTLE_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'm...so hungry...\nI'm starving... Starving, starving...\nStarving, starving... STARVING STARVING!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "offset": "BATTLE_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "They've chased us this far...\nThe Embryon...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "offset": "HARRY_EVENT_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "G-Get away from me!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "offset": "PARTY_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Try something new.\nBlock the path and drive him\ninto a dead end.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "offset": "HARRY_EVENT_03_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I'll give you my territory\nand my hideout...\nJust leave me alone!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "offset": "BERU_ROOM_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> An ominous air can be felt\nfrom underneath.\nIt's too dark to see into the room.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "offset": "BERU_ROOM_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> An ominous air can be felt\nfrom underneath.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "offset": "BATTLE_BERU_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "You know, Boss...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "offset": "BATTLE_BERU_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Shouldn't there be absolute laws\nover the Junkyard?\nWe should only be subject to\nthe laws of nature.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "offset": "BATTLE_BERU_03",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "In other words...\nSomeone as weak as you doesn't deserve\nto be in charge.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "offset": "BATTLE_BERU_04",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Ugh...\nDon't think that you've surpassed\nme, Boss...\nI... I'll devour others to\ngrow strong...\nWhen next we meet, you will fall!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "offset": "BATTLE_BERU_05",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "> Beelzebub disappeared.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "offset": "AREA45_NPC01_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "I tried stopping you.\nI'm not responsible for what\nhappens next!",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
