    {
      "id": 77,
      "offset": "AREA26_NPC01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "It's a dead-end past here, boss.\nThat red wall appeared out of nowhere\nand sealed off the basement.\nThe guys guarding Him were\ntrapped inside, too...",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 78,
      "offset": "AREA26_NPC01_02",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Are you going up ahead, sir?\nBe careful, He's no rookie.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 79,
      "offset": "AREA27_NPC01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
      "nom_fr": "",
      "texte_orig": "Whoa, don't get any closer.\nThere's a guy locked away...\nHe went crazy, and wouldn't stop\ndevouring people...\nHe was delirious, going on about\nthe Wicked King... then began\neating his own allies.\nWe need to isolate him until\nhe dies of starvation.",
      "texte_fr": "",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "id": 80,
      "offset": "AREA29_NPC01_01",
      "block_type": "msg",
      "nom_orig": "",
